<title>POLAND: PEKPOL GROUP NET FALLS IN 1996.</title>
<headline>PEKPOL GROUP NET FALLS IN 1996.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pekpol SA consolidated results</p>
<p>for the year 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						  1996	  1995</p>
<p>    Group operating profit		 3.30 vs     5.05</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		   3.81 vs     5.55</p>
<p>    Group net profit			 1.13 vs     3.66</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Pekpol SA.</p>
<p>    Group net sales			323.95 vs   249.42</p>
<p>    Group costs of sales		 296.23 vs   227.99</p>
<p>    Group extraordinary loss	     0.02 vs     0.03 profit</p>
