<p>    Group other taxes			0.0  vs     0.0</p>
<p>    Group financial revenues	     7.01 vs     4.04</p>
<p>    Group financial costs		  6.65 vs     3.85</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
